## Key Metrics

- **Baseline MIA AUC:** 0.769 → advantage = 0.538 (model memorizes structured data)
- **Retrain AUC:** 0.481 → advantage = 0.038 (gold standard)
- **Success criterion:** Worst-case attack advantage ≤ upper bound of retrain advantage 95% CI
- **Advantage:** `2 × |AUC - 0.5|` (direction-agnostic, avoids AUC < 0.5 confusion)

