## Established Findings (from Writeup)

### PBMC-33k Results

| Method | Structured AUC | Scattered AUC | Key Finding |
|--------|---------------|---------------|-------------|
| Baseline (no unlearning) | 0.769 | 0.525 | Structured cells memorized; scattered near chance |
| Extra-gradient λ=10 | 0.482 (target) | — | Works for single-cluster n=30 only |
| Extra-gradient λ=5 | 0.382 (over-unlearn) | — | Streisand effect |
| Fisher scrubbing | 0.814 (fail) | 0.499 | Posterior collapse on structured; marginal on scattered |
| Frozen critics | >0.98 (fail) | — | VAE exploits fixed decision boundaries |

### Tabula Muris Results

| Method | Structured AUC | Scattered AUC | Key Finding |
|--------|---------------|---------------|-------------|
| Baseline | 0.891 | 0.411 | Higher structured memorization than PBMC |
| Extra-gradient λ=10 | 0.874 (fail) | — | Does not generalize; all λ ∈ [5,20] fail |
| Fisher scrubbing | 0.946 (fail) | 0.568 (worsened) | Posterior collapse confirmed cross-dataset |

### Size Ablation (PBMC)

| Size | Clusters | EG λ=10 AUC | Fisher Scattered AUC | Fisher Baseline |
|------|----------|-------------|---------------------|-----------------|
| 10 | 13 (subset) | 0.37 (over-unlearn) | 0.588 | 0.626 |
| 30 | 13 (all) | 0.48 (target) | 0.601 | 0.589 |
| 50 | 13+12 | 0.61 (fail) | 0.574 | 0.586 |
| 100 | 13+12+11 | 0.59 (fail) | 0.547 | 0.553 |
| 500 | random | — | 0.516 | 0.524 |

**Important context:**
- Extra-gradient λ=10 only works for single-cluster structured sets near n=30 on PBMC
- Multi-cluster forget sets and Tabula Muris both cause the method to fail
- Fisher provides only marginal privacy beyond already-weak scattered baselines (deltas -0.01 to 0.04)
- The structured-scattered distinction is primarily about memorization strength, not method effectiveness
- 75% success rate across seeds (3 of 4) for the one configuration that works

